

>> Cat := Ntho ncha.

Cat ha-ho-fihla: ['ncha'] etsa: {
	ea-hao sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat ha-ho-fihla: ['nieuw'] etsa: {
	ea-hao sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat ha-ho-fihla: ['makeSound'] etsa: { <- ea-hao sound.
}.

Cat ha-ho-fihla: ['greet'] etsa: { <- uena makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat ncha.
Sephetho ngola: cat greet.
